                    "retweet_count": 0,
                    "source": "dogebackup",
                    "text": "Rep. Norcross\u2019 bill finally tackles D.C.\u2019s epic fail on opioid treatment. Methadone rules from the disco era? Bureaucratic bloat at its finest. The Modernizing Opioid Treatment Access Act (H.R. 1359) lets pharmacies and docs do their jobs\u2014finally. Bipartisan support? Even Congress can act when pushed. But 50 years? Over 100,000 overdose deaths later, D.C. admits its methadone monopoly was deadly. Taxpayers deserve action\u2014not excuses. Fix it, then brag.",
